  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "結晶が　あしらわれた　木彫りの面。オーガポンに　持たせるとほのおタイプを　まとい　戦う。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "결정이 장식되어 있는 목각 가면. 오거폰에게 지니게 하면 불꽃타입을 두르고 싸울 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用結晶裝飾的木雕面具。讓厄鬼椪攜帶後，戰鬥時就會有火屬性附上其身。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un masque en bois orné de cristaux. Si Ogerpon le tient, il prend le type Feu lors des combats.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Item, das von Ogerpon getragen werden kann. Durch diese mit Kristallen verzierte, hölzerne Maske nimmt es im Kampf den Typ Feuer an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Máscara de madera con cristales engarzados. Si la lleva Ogerpon, le permite adoptar el tipo Fuego para luchar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una maschera di legno intagliato ornata di cristalli. Se data a Ogerpon, gli consente di lottare assumendo il tipo Fuoco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by Ogerpon. This carved wooden mask is adorned with crystals and allows Ogerpon to wield the Fire type during battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "結晶が　あしらわれた　木彫りの面。オーガポンに　持たせるとほのおタイプを　まとい　戦う。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用结晶装饰的木雕面具。让厄诡椪携带后，就会用火属性覆盖全身进行战斗。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
